            "rect": [
                352,
                417,
                24,
                24
            ],
            "text": "The S3 storage class requested for new uploads. STANDARD is the default. Other classes can have different access, retrieval and storage costs; use a value supported by your destination. This setting doesn't change the class of existing objects."
