            "rect": [
                421,
                577,
                24,
                24
            ],
            "text": "The minimum sustained transfer rate in whole KB/s (1 KB = 1024 bytes). The default, Any progress, treats any data still moving as progress. A transfer below this rate for the low-speed window is considered stalled. This is a stall threshold, not an upload speed limit or a file-size limit."
        },
